hybrid cloud: on-premises and in cloud combined

storage gateway: bridge between on-premises and cloud data

tape: an event in time which records a certain object.

types of storage gateway:

  1) S3 file gateway: s3 buckets are available using nfs or smb protocol which is send over the internet via https. Data is cached in the file gateway.
  2) volume gateway: block storage accesed by ISCSI protoco which is send over the internet via HTTPS
  3) tape gateway: back up data via ISCSI using existing tape-based processes

VTL/virtual tape library: a library of taped files

aws transfer family: a fully-managed service for file transfer into and out of amazon S3

